  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:600">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Plans</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Hello</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="intro">
      <div style="flex:1">
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Plans framed around what you want to keep</h1>
          <p class="muted">No cookie-cutter tiers. Each plan names the commitment level and the practice it supports.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside style="width:280px">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Support model</strong>
          <p class="muted">A hybrid of coaching calls and practical deliverables: short daily tasks, weekly reflections, and a living habit map.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="plans">
      <div class="plan card" id="sprint">
        <h3>Practice Sprint</h3>
        <div class="price">$320 / 4 weeks</div>
        <div class="muted">Pick one habit. Daily micro-checks with two coaching calls. Designed for quick, visible change.</div>
        <a class="cta" href="book.html">Join a sprint</a>
        <div class="note">Space is limited — plan includes a short onboarding sequence to keep focus.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan card" id="steady">
        <h3>Steady Course</h3>
        <div class="price">$880 / 6 weeks</div>
        <div class="muted">Weekly sessions, tailored experiments, and a shared habit map you keep. Meant for gradual, durable shifts.</div>
        <a class="cta" href="book.html">Enroll in the course</a>
        <div class="note">Includes email check-ins and two short reflections between calls.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan card">
        <h3>Personal Framework</h3>
        <div class="price">Custom</div>
        <div class="muted">If you want a bespoke structure (team or extended project), we design a framework and a living plan together.</div>
        <a class="cta" href="contact.html">Request a proposal</a>
        <div class="note">We frame pricing around time commitments and deliverables — flexible, transparent.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Try a guided practice</h3>
        <p class="muted">Experience a short reset: choose breathing, journaling, or a simple intention setting.</p>
        <div class="try" style="display:flex;gap:8px">
          <button class="cta" style="background:#4f9a55;border:none" onclick="openExercise('breathing')">Breathing reset</button>
          <button class="cta" style="background:#3d8b4a;border:none" onclick="openExercise('journaling')">Journaling prompt</button>
          <button class="cta" style="background:#2f7f3f;border:none" onclick="openExercise('intention')">Set intention</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Questions</h3>
        <div style="margin-top:8px">
          <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong>How are plans priced?</strong><div class="muted">Pricing ties to duration and level of hands-on design. You’ll see clear deliverables up front.</div></div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong>Are these medical services?</strong><div class="muted">No. These are coaching and habit-design services focused on habits, outcomes, and frameworks.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <div id="exercise-modal" style="display:none;position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(6,8,6,.36)" aria-hidden="true">
